                                                            <string key="content">Once a MAD file is created, you may design a query for it.  The query builder allows you to add tables, link those tables, group the tables, and add predicates.  This feature requires advanced database or data analysis skills.  The user is required to design queries that are sane and efficient.</string>
                                                            <attributes>
                                                                <color key="NSColor" cocoaTouchSystemColor="darkTextColor"/>
                                                                <font key="NSFont" size="17" name="Helvetica-Light"/>
                                                                <font key="NSOriginalFont" size="17" name="Helvetica-Light"/>
                                                                <paragraphStyle key="NSParagraphStyle" alignment="left" lineBreakMode="wordWrapping" baseWritingDirection="natural"/>
                                                            </attributes>
                                                        </fragment>
                                                    </attributedString>
                                                    <nil key="highlightedColor"/>
